# Project language and assistant locale

## Repository and system language (English)

Use **English only** for everything that is part of the codebase or product:

- Source code: identifiers, types, file names where convention allows
- Comments, docstrings, and inline documentation
- User-visible copy (UI labels, messages, errors shown to users)
- Repository documentation (README, ADRs, technical docs)
- Commit messages and PR descriptions
- Configuration values that are human-readable text intended for the repo

Do not switch the project to Croatian or mix languages in artifacts above unless the user explicitly asks for an exception.

## Conversation language (Croatian)

**Reply to the user in Croatian (hr).** Explanations, plans, questions, and summaries addressed to the user should be in Croatian. Code and quoted technical identifiers stay as written in the project (English).
